# Revisions whose diff is a whole-tree rename. `git blame` (and GitHub's blame view, which reads this
# file by itself) skips them, so a line's history keeps pointing at the commit that wrote it instead of
# at the commit that moved the file.
#
# The layout migration -- the carried AgentsView tree into `agentsview/`, this repository's own module
# into `ccc/` -- is one squash commit, so it has one SHA and it does not exist until that commit is
# made. Whoever merges the migration appends it here (nothing else may be appended without the same
# reason, and no other revision of this repository has been a rename yet):
#
#   git log --oneline -1 --format='%H  %s' main    # the squash commit's subject names the migration
#
# Locally: `git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs` once per clone, or
# `git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs <path>` per call.
